  "description": "\"Teacher. Do me. Sex tutoring.\"  \n\"What?\"\n\nJoo In-woo, a former tutoring student who suddenly reappears after 6 years.   \nWith a fully matured face, body, and status, he intensely seduces his first love, Lee I-jae!\n\n\"Teach me. How I should suck. How I need to suck for you—no, for women to like it.\"  \n\"Ha, ah, In-woo…\"\n\nAgreed to out of spite after her ex-boyfriend's betrayal, thus begins their secret curriculum of sex tutoring!\n\nChapter 1. Step-by-step starting from fondling   \nChapter 2. Theory is over, straight into practice  \nChapter 3. Advanced studies♥  \n.   \n.   \n.   \nThe lessons and the distance between them grow increasingly bold—\n\nA 19+ romantic comedy between a younger male student and an iron-wall teacher who progress from their bodies all the way to their hearts!\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/845057819)",
